        "topic": "Surveys that come to you",
        "order": 0,
        "message": {
          "title": "Welcome to EarnCord",
          "body": "Surveys that come to you.\n\nEarnCord matches Discord members to paid surveys, scores quality in public, and pays out in USDT when completes clear.\n\n18+ · Not affiliated with Discord Inc.",
          "sections": [
            {
              "header": "Start here",
              "bullets": [
                "Read #rules",
                "Check #how-it-works",
                "Browse #surveys",
                "Say hi in #general"
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": "Links",
              "bullets": [
                "https://jmenichole.github.io/earncord/",
                "https://jmenichole.github.io/earncord/privacy.html",
                "https://jmenichole.github.io/earncord/terms.html"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "rules",
        "type": "text",
        "permissionsPreset": "public-readonly",
        "pinMessage": true,
        "topic": "18+ · community guidelines",
        "order": 1,
        "message": {
          "title": "EarnCord Rules",
          "body": "1. 18+ only — no exceptions.\n2. Be respectful. No harassment, scams, or spam.\n3. No fake completes, multi-accounting, or fraud.\n4. Never share seed phrases or private keys — staff will never ask.\n5. Keep support in tickets so we can help efficiently.\n6. Follow Discord’s Terms of Service.\n\nBreak these and we may warn, mute, or ban."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "about",
        "type": "text",
        "permissionsPreset": "public-readonly",
        "topic": "What EarnCord is",
        "order": 2,
        "message": {
          "title": "About EarnCord",
          "body": "Official product + support server for EarnCord.\n\nMatch → Verify → Payout. Partner postbacks credit your balance before you withdraw USDT.",
          "sections": [
            {
              "header": "Product",
              "bullets": ["https://jmenichole.github.io/earncord/"]
            },
            {
              "header": "Support",
              "bullets": [
                "Open a ticket in #create-ticket",
                "jmenichole007@outlook.com"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "faq",
        "type": "text",
        "permissionsPreset": "public-readonly",
        "topic": "Common questions",
        "order": 3,
        "message": {
          "title": "FAQ",
          "body": "Quick answers. For account or payout issues, open a ticket.",
          "sections": [
            {
              "header": "How does matching work?",
              "content": "We match survey inventory to your profile and public quality score — not endless offerwalls."
            },
            {
              "header": "What is the quality score?",
              "content": "Completes and honest answers raise it; fraud or low-quality traffic lowers match rate."
            },
            {
              "header": "When do USDT payouts clear?",
              "content": "After partner postbacks verify the complete. Withdraw when your balance is ready."
            },
            {
              "header": "Which partners?",
              "content": "Survey partners such as TheoremReach (and others as we go live)."
            },
            {
              "header": "Do you ever ask for seed phrases?",
              "content": "Never. We only need a payout wallet address you control."
            },
            {
              "header": "How do I get help?",
              "content": "Open a support ticket — Account/Login, Survey Match, Payouts/USDT, Bug Report, or Other."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "announcements",
        "type": "announcement",
        "permissionsPreset": "announcement-lock",
        "topic": "Official EarnCord updates",
        "order": 4
      }
    ],
